7:["$","p",null,{"children":"Since then the association has done three things: represented member schools in court, kept them informed of orders and departmental letters that affect their recognition, and put their case to the School and Mass Education Department and the Board of Secondary Education."}]
8:["$","p",null,{"children":"Member schools are organised into six zones covering the state. Each zone maintains its own list of schools, and zone representatives carry local matters to the association office."}]
